    "title": "Body Found in Pickens County Pond; Sheriff's Office Investigating - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Caleb Ward ,\n1 days ago PICKENS COUNTY, S.C. — Authorities have launched an investigation after a man’s body was discovered in a pond in Easley, South Carolina, on Monday afternoon. Deputies from the Pickens County Sheriff’s Office said they responded just before 2 p.m. to a 911 call in the 400 block of Crest Drive, where human remains were reported near the pond. Emergency medical services also arrived at the scene. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
